⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
352 calories 32g protein (for the entire pint, including toppings/mix-ins)

Gimme S’mores! Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 125 recipes like this one!

- 1 Vanilla Protein Shake (I like the ones from @Nurri)
- 20-25g @Lakanto Monk Fruit sweetener
- 15g toasted mini marshmallows
- 1g (¼ tsp) salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins:
- 15g chocolate chips + 2g coconut oil
Chocolate chip hack:
- Right before the Mix-In cycle, combine 15g of chocolate with 2g of coconut oil, melt in the microwave (30 sec intervals, stirring in between), hollow out a hole in the center of the base, and pour in. After spinning on the Mix-In setting, it’ll turn into perfect, creamy chocolate chips.
- 2 @OREO Thins, cream removed
- ½ sheet of a graham cracker
- 2.5g mini lucky-charms-style marshmallows (I use the ones from @jetpuffed)
352 cal 39g C, 11g F, 32g P

Instructions:
1. Toast the mini marshmallows
2. Blend all ingredients for the base (marshmallows included) and freeze (at least 16 hours)
3. Run under hot water for at least 60 seconds
4. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
5. Respin if powdery
6. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with the melted chocolate and Oreos
7. Run the “Mix-in” cycle
8. Top with the mini marshmallows and crumbled up graham cracker

